{"4948530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rabbits Hunt 2", "steam_appid": 4948530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4948580], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>“Rabbits Hunt 2” is a point-and-click exploration horror game set in an old Japanese house.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a member of “Rabbit Hunters,” an organization that investigates malevolent rabbit spirits and supernatural phenomena, the player visits a certain house alongside their partner, Loppy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/extras/b2239607e2a896059616aacefa3d8a52.avif?t=1786415512\" width=967 height=543 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rumor has it that a family suicide took place there eight years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, as you examine the traces left behind, it gradually becomes clear that a different truth lies hidden behind that incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is an exploration-based horror game that progresses through “investigation” rather than combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Click on suspicious spots, keep an eye out for changes, and follow the memories and supernatural phenomena left behind in the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the demo, you can explore “Outside the House,” where the story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The eerie sense of unease lingering in front of the entrance, the dark foyer visible through the peephole, and the supernatural phenomena that seem to test anyone who approaches the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Silent terror, a stifling atmosphere, and sudden supernatural occurrences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended for fans of J-horror set in traditional Japanese houses, escape games, and point-and-click adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/extras/a01b67b6bdb823948784eab3e54a87c3.avif?t=1786415512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/extras_big/a01b67b6bdb823948784eab3e54a87c3.webp?t=1786415512 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>“Rabbits Hunt 2” is a point-and-click exploration horror game set in an old Japanese house.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a member of “Rabbit Hunters,” an organization that investigates malevolent rabbit spirits and supernatural phenomena, the player visits a certain house alongside their partner, Loppy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/extras/b2239607e2a896059616aacefa3d8a52.avif?t=1786415512\" width=967 height=543 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rumor has it that a family suicide took place there eight years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, as you examine the traces left behind, it gradually becomes clear that a different truth lies hidden behind that incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is an exploration-based horror game that progresses through “investigation” rather than combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Click on suspicious spots, keep an eye out for changes, and follow the memories and supernatural phenomena left behind in the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the demo, you can explore “Outside the House,” where the story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The eerie sense of unease lingering in front of the entrance, the dark foyer visible through the peephole, and the supernatural phenomena that seem to test anyone who approaches the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Silent terror, a stifling atmosphere, and sudden supernatural occurrences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended for fans of J-horror set in traditional Japanese houses, escape games, and point-and-click adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/extras/a01b67b6bdb823948784eab3e54a87c3.avif?t=1786415512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/extras_big/a01b67b6bdb823948784eab3e54a87c3.webp?t=1786415512 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Rabbits Hunt 2 is a point-and-click exploration horror game set in an old Japanese house. With your partner Roppy, investigate a home tied to a family tragedy and follow strange traces toward the truth. No combat, only observation, unease, and quiet J-horror.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/669b03b79f9d9bdeb8b1dd5f66b4ecc26e610084/header.jpg?t=1786415512", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4948530/1aa528